<section class="sec" data-reveal>
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-head__pre">about</span>
      <h1 class="sec-head__main">Helbrede Nutraherbs</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p><strong>Helbrede makes Ayurvedic and nutraceutical formulas across four areas —
      health, skin, hair and liver — and publishes what is in them.</strong></p>
      <p>That last part is the whole idea. This category is full of products described
      in adjectives: “enriched with”, “rich in”, “powered by”. Very few of them tell you
      how much of the active you are actually getting. We print the quantity of every
      active as it appears on the pack, and where a quantity is genuinely not declared,
      we say that too rather than filling the gap with language.</p>
      <p>Our formulas are manufactured at a GMP-certified facility — Kenko Healthcare in
      Panchkula, Haryana — and marketed by Helbrede Healthcare Ltd. Both names appear on
      every pack, which is not universal in this industry.</p>
      <p>We also make both halves of a routine. A Biotin, Zinc and Selenium tablet and a
      scalp serum. An L-Glutathione capsule and a Niacinamide serum. Most wellness brands
      sell you only the ingestible or only the topical; being able to lay out the whole
      day is the practical advantage of a multi-category range, and it is why the
      <a href="/pages/ritual-builder">Ritual Builder</a> exists.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--tint" data-reveal>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-head__pre">what we</span>
      <h2 class="sec-head__main">Will not do</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="vals" data-reveal-stagger>
      <div class="val"><span class="val__ico">{% render 'icon', name: 'flask', size: 21 %}</span>
        <h3 class="val__t">Claim to treat disease</h3>
        <p class="val__b">These are nutraceutical and Ayurvedic proprietary formulations. They support and maintain. They do not cure, and we will not write copy that implies they do.</p></div>
      <div class="val"><span class="val__ico">{% render 'icon', name: 'shield', size: 21 %}</span>
        <h3 class="val__t">Hide the safety information</h3>
        <p class="val__b">Interactions and contraindications sit on the product page, above the fold of the section — not buried in a policy link.</p></div>
      <div class="val"><span class="val__ico">{% render 'icon', name: 'leaf', size: 21 %}</span>
        <h3 class="val__t">Use proprietary blends</h3>
        <p class="val__b">A blend name with a total weight hides how little of the expensive ingredient is in there. We list actives individually.</p></div>
      <div class="val"><span class="val__ico">{% render 'icon', name: 'phone', size: 21 %}</span>
        <h3 class="val__t">Leave you with a chatbot</h3>
        <p class="val__b">A real Ayurvedic consultant will call you back, free, and is allowed to tell you that you do not need a supplement.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
